OL,3,GNEWSAScotland remembers the fallen on
OL,4,AArmistice Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across Scotland have
OL,7,Fobserved a two-minute silence in
OL,8,Ftribute to those who lost their lives
OL,9,Fin conflicts around the world.
OL,11,FA pause for reflection took place at
OL,12,F11:00 GMT to mark the end of World War
OL,13,FOne.
OL,15,FA national remembrance service also
OL,16,Ftook place at the Cenotaph in London,
OL,17,Fwith ceremonies and a two-minute
OL,18,Fsilence observed in Wales and Northern
OL,19,FIreland.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
