OL,3,GNEWSAScotland remembers the fallen on
OL,4,AArmistice Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FWreaths were laid at war memorials
OL,7,Facross the country, including at the
OL,8,FScott Monument in Edinburgh and Glasgow
OL,9,FCentral Station.
